{
  "name": "The whole day in one list",
  "bet": "Every booking of the day in one list she never leaves, with the rooms and the waiting list one place away, lets her move a booking the moment a practitioner calls in sick.",
  "cost": "The list is long on a full day: fifteen rows before she sees the end of the morning, and a free room is found by reading, not at a glance.",
  "absent": [
    "A plan of the building",
    "Any day but today",
    "The practitioners' holiday calendar, which the Physiotherapeutengemeinschaftspraxis keeps on paper"
  ],
  "hardest": "When a practitioner is off sick with nine bookings left, she ticks them in the list and moves them in one go; a booking that fits no other room stays ticked, with the reason beside it.",
